            "body": "Yeah, It seems a little bit complex, but I'll think about it.\r\nWhat might help me make a decision:\r\n- More people having this request (please upvote first comment with emoji).\r\n- More people share what their crucial functionality is. Like:\r\n    - Do you use all of 'aiAI` or just `ai`?\r\n    - Do you use any of `inb` etc. (like `d2inb` \"will skip one next pair (any kind) and delete in the one after (any kind)\")?\r\n    - Do you have anything \"must have\" in this type of plugin?",
